          "question": "e-9126",
          "field": null,
          "attribute": "question/problem",
          "value": "|  | $Y=0$ | $Y=1$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $\\dfrac a2$ | $a$ |\n| $X=1$ | $a$ | $\\dfrac 52a$ |\n\nThe joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ for the discrete random variables $X$ and $Y$ is given above. Find the value of $a.$",
          "category": "ma_capture",
          "file": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14061806/example-9126.json",
